# UNDERDELVE: the lizard trades Mo's pick for the spark rod. The hungry pick
# hits twice as hard, but it sits where only a death on its spikes can take
# him: the sacrifice.
game underdelve
wait 10
press A
wait 5
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 6 7 67 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
press UP
expect weapon == 1
cheat weapon 0
cheat room 2 4 115 4
wait 120
expect lanterns == 5
expect py < 40
expect px > 200
cheat pos 258 34
wait 10
press B
wait 20
expect weapon == 2
expect items & 128
